# Independent review of graph/4.5.kg (semantic machinery). One review node per claim, each naming the digest it read. PDF sources were read in the study's pdftotext copies (icon.txt, verse.txt, schulte.txt, traits.txt, bacon.txt, sel4.txt); web pages were fetched again as raw page bytes on 2026-11-24.

n: 9.5.12
kind: hub
name: review-of-semantic-machinery
is: All 40 claims of 4.5.kg (24 observations, 16 findings) were read against their sources: 30 confirmed, 10 amended (4.5.1.2, 4.5.1.10, 4.5.3.7, 4.5.4, 4.5.8.1, 4.5.8.5, 4.5.8.6, 4.5.8.7, 4.5.9.3, 4.5.9.4), none disputed, none left unreviewed. The 6 PDFs were read in the study's text copies at the cited lines and all 25 web sources were fetched again as raw bytes, the two relayed ones (the WAM copy and the Erlang manual) included; five of the amendments are limit lines that second-round nodes under 3.12, 3.14 and 3.15 have overtaken.
at: 2026-11-24

